            "created_at": "2025-09-19T15:42:50.709039+00:00",
            "notes": "In the second round, [Tranquilizer](item_2bea20a0-21c0-4a52-b81e-596c17d184b4) will give you a huge boost with your sleeps \u2014 seriously, a massive one! What once felt impossible will now be a walk in the park. Less experienced players will learn to worship this power.\n\nIf you can\u2019t afford [Tranquilizer](item_2bea20a0-21c0-4a52-b81e-596c17d184b4), sell your green ones!\nBut if you can afford to keep one or two, I recommend going for [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) / [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf)\nIn the early rounds, you should stay away from direct fights, so you shouldn\u2019t have too many survivability issues anyway!",
