            "created_at": "2025-09-19T15:42:50.709039+00:00",
            "notes": "Now things get interesting. By adding [No Scope Needed](item_823db5eb-5a24-4bac-b850-0aa34e76b4f6) + [Potent Projectiles](item_7e9a8017-9458-4318-aea9-5e80ba7e3c46) to your arsenal, you'll be able to move more smoothly during fights. With the right positioning, you\u2019ll keep your teammates alive while dishing out damage without mercy.\n\n If you have enough points, I strongly recommend picking up [Dash Boots](item_1ec670c7-a465-4ca0-9d16-aeeedab7894e) as well \u2014 Ana\u2019s only mobility tool. Don\u2019t underestimate it, and don\u2019t second-guess it. In Stadium, anything can happen, and this dash will keep you alive !",
