            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-19T15:42:50.709039+00:00",
            "notes": "At this point, two scenarios open up:\n1. You have plenty of points available and you\u2019ve already picked up [Dash Boots](item_1ec670c7-a465-4ca0-9d16-aeeedab7894e) earlier \u2014 in that case, feel free to spend them however you prefer! By now, you can use this guide to skip a round and get ahead, or just have fun making small adjustments based on your needs and playstyle.\n\n2. You don\u2019t have enough points to go for the epic powers, so it's better to stay grounded and start by picking up [Dash Boots](item_1ec670c7-a465-4ca0-9d16-aeeedab7894e) first. You can also help yourself with [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56), which will further reduce the cooldown of your abilities \u2014 more sleep, more health and don't forget...overall survivability!",
