            "created_at": "2025-09-19T15:42:50.709039+00:00",
            "notes": "Once you\u2019ve picked up [Comfy Cloud](item_d975b671-2810-4ce3-a367-32b075c39f91) you\u2019ll be able to deal more damage with your Sleep Darts \u2014 even if they last a bit less. \n\nBut we don\u2019t care. \n\nWe sleep people because they\u2019re being annoying, because we want to cancel their ults, or simply because they dared to flank.\n\nAnd what could be better, given all that potential, than [Lethal Dose](item_b919494d-1a33-408a-ba2b-7e3cc24b59c8)? Even more damage!\n\nAfter this round, trust me \u2014 enemies will think twice before messing with you!\nOf course, if you\u2019re loaded with points and feel like spending, go ahead! There are alternatives \u2014 at least the ones I found most effective \u2014 but don\u2019t be afraid to experiment.\n\nI myself took inspiration from other builds I found online, and what you see here is the result of my own experience. I always encourage people not to blindly copy builds \u2014 sure, sometimes they\u2019ll work just fine, and as a foundation they\u2019re all perfectly valid (some are even ridiculously broken).\n\nBut if you\u2019ve got enough experience with your favorite hero \u2014 or if you\u2019re just starting to gain it \u2014 experimenting will only help you improve and grow!",
