            "created_at": "2025-09-19T15:42:50.709039+00:00",
            "notes": "For the final round, I\u2019m leaving the choice completely up to you.\n\nAt this point, every hero becomes so strong it\u2019s almost disgusting \u2014 most of them can one-clip without breaking a sweat. So, you have two paths to choose from:\n\nYou can choose [Home Remedy](item_de68ba66-26d5-4136-a0c1-6396d3f1b0c7) to boost your biotic grenades, giving your team an absurd amount of overhealth.\n\nOr you can go all-in on **Nano Boost** to unleash even scarier offensive potential.\nIf you go for the second option, consider picking up [Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4) \u2014 we\u2019ve already reduced our cooldowns, so if your aim is solid and you make good use of your abilities, you\u2019ll have more chances to Nano and terrify the enemy team. On certain maps and on the right heroes, this kind of choice can be absolutely game-changing!\n\nWhatever you decide, don\u2019t worry \u2014 you\u2019ve got this! \ud83d\ude04\nLet me know in the comments if you enjoyed the build!",
